  configuration -- see fabric-hosting.md's platform-limits table and
  README.md). Not yet confirmed against the real HelloWorld item template:
  replace this with that template's own ItemManifest.xml, renamed, once this
  project is dropped into the Starter-Kit (README.md "What's not included").
-->
<ItemManifestConfiguration>
  <Item TypeName="NexoraRunItem" Category="Data">
